<title>SWEDEN: TENNIS-SWEDEN BEAT SOUTH AFRICA 3-2 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SWEDEN BEAT SOUTH AFRICA 3-2 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>VAXJO, SWEDEN 1997-04-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden beat South Africa</p>
<p>3-2 in their Davis Cup World Group second round tie on Sunday:</p>
<p>Results of reverse singles:</p>
<p>Wayne Ferreira (South Africa) beat Thomas Enqvist (Sweden) 6-4</p>
<p>6-4 6-4</p>
<p>Jonas Bjorkman (Sweden) beat Grant Stafford (South Africa) 3-6</p>
<p>6-0 3-6 6-2 6-2</p>
</text>
